Listen to the best radio stations and news sources of the Philippines in our application. You can choose from sports, news, music and other radio stations.

Yes FM, Love Radio, Radyo Romansa, Monster Radio, DZRH, Pinoy Radio, AWFM, iFM, DWFM, MOR, DZXL RMN, Radyo Kabayan, Radio Maria, Rakista Radio, Boracay, PHR, DWIZ, DZAS, Y101FM, Easy Rock etc.

Now you can listen to the best radio stations in your country when you are abroad.

With our app you can:
- Listen to the best radio stations of the Philippines;
- Listen to the best podcasts from Philippines;
- Read the best news sources from Philippines;
- Preview the top charts from Philippines
- Share with others via Facebook, Twitter, SMS or Email;
- Listen radios in the background or via bluetooth.

There may be some radio stations that do not work because their stream is offline.This application is optimized for 3G networks and Wi-Fi.

Turn famous classics into Hip-Hop right on-stage! Prefer Dance or Pop? Go ahead and play it, just like a real musician!

Have real fun, explore the world's greatest music masterpieces via an engaging simulator game with unique modern beats and arrangements.
Simple Piano is an extraordinary way to relax and express yourself in music. A mixture of creativity, fun and experiment embodied in a music tiles gameplay.
No need to be a musician to simply pick and play tracks of your favourite style - Hip-Hop, Dance, Pop. You will learn different musical instruments and their role in contemporary genres. Mix piano with drums and synthesizer to perform songs as a band. There is also a special Piano Classics category for those who would like to enjoy a "piano only" experience.

All our content is exclusively made by professional musicians to inspire and entertain you. Play Simple Piano and discover the piano music in a new way!

Free for your iPhone or iPad.

App features:
- Piano and Drums tiles games;
- Famous songs in Pop, Hip-Hop, Classic and other styles;
- New hits added regularly;
- Different musical instruments: Piano, Electro Synthesizer, Drums;
- Solo piano freeplay mode;
- Free piano songs.

